#            the usable width — and read by both the wire schema and the
#            producers.
#
#            What the seeded measurements say about everything else, since a
#            scalability round that reports only its one bug has not said
#            whether the rest is safe:
#
#            Exhibit F is quadratic in the class count twice over: one row per
#            breakpoint, and every row names every class participating in that
#            tranche with its share. Against the real engine's output — 24 KB of
#            HTML at 26 classes, 69 KB at 50, 235 KB at 100 — the 200,000-
