#            revenue over `status = 'paid'` and would silently omit an `open`
#            row — and it held only because no second writer had ever been
#            added. It is written down now, in three places that check each
#            other: INVOICE_TRANSITIONS in the domain, the CHECK constraint read
#            back out of pg_constraint, and a source scan for who writes the
#            column. Both scans refuse to pass on an empty match, which is the
#            failure mode a census of an absence has.
