#            round re-confirmed by watching the pair test pass against the
#            broken code. So it is staged where the window actually is: the
#            other delivery's row commits between this one's read and its write,
#            which is precisely the state the losing delivery finds, and
#            everything after that is the real handler. Both fixes were
#            confirmed by reverting them: the receipt reappears naming
#            INV-202608-0001 against a stored INV-RACE-…, and the cancellation
#            date moves by the milliseconds between the two deliveries.
#
# gap:       A full refund takes `valuations.paid_status` back to 'unpaid' and
#            leaves the workflow `state` on 'paid' — the state migration 0107
#            added to mean "payment has settled, awaiting an analyst". The
