#            normalisation, the same breakpoint segmentation, a Black-Scholes
#            call at every breakpoint. They are not two allocations.
#            `class_volatilities`' own docstring says its deltas are "the
#            term-by-term derivative of the very sum `_allocate` uses for the
#            values" — the second call recomputed the thing the first had
